{"title":"Titanium Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 56) · Monster drop: Thak Footman, Thak Spearman, Kharim The Sunscald, Virikh, Lord Vorhal The Dragonbane +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · STR 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 56 <span class=\"muted\">(8719 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (2 / 2,256 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - Normal, 0.2% of recorded drops (2 / 934 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.2%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"raider-high-chief\" title=\"Kharim The Sunscald - Normal, 14.3% of recorded drops (1 / 7 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/66901fffbf454001df96.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kharim The Sunscald</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14.3%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (1 / 188 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/993a67bc5741c6a90a9a.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-lord\" title=\"Lord Vorhal The Dragonbane - Normal, 16.7% of recorded drops (1 / 6 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/77a5528d6cb96f23f564.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lord Vorhal The Dragonbane</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">16.7%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-shieldbearer\" title=\"Siegemaster Grukh - Normal, 1.0% of recorded drops (1 / 96 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/4032e328046366254547.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Siegemaster Grukh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.0%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"titanium-torso\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/titanium-torso\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-torso?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-crude\" href=\"#/item/titanium-torso?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/titanium-torso?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/titanium-torso?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/titanium-torso?q=good\">Good <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/titanium-torso?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-torso?q=superior\">Superior <span>2